ler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/08/01/0122581/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"友達とか家族とかと行ったこと\n何回あるけど高1ぶりくらいで\nもう忘れてた(´・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/08/01/0122581/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"隣のレーンの上手い人ずっと見てたのと\n団体戦じゃなくなって\nガターでもいいやって思ったら\n力抜けたみたい(´・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/08/01/0122581/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ならなかったなー(゜ロ゜)\nそんなたくさん投げてないからかな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日の個別"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"宿題"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/08/01/0122581/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コンビニで最近よく買う物やおすすめの物は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/08/01/0122581/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今季のドラマでどれが今のところ面白い？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ループしすぎて話題ないとき\n初めましてで何話したらいいかわかんないとき\n答えを教えてください(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"持ち物チェック"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"□握手券\n□身分証明書\n(□トレード用の写真等)\n(□グッズ買うためのお金)\n□推しに対する愛"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"待ってます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は2部のあとに\nお昼ご飯にすぐに行かないで\n会場に残ってたらなんか良いことあるかもよ`・ω・´w"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph",